                    <seg rendition="#center">No. 360</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Spanish inclusion in the Western defense community, including NATO, was discussed at the Western European
                    Ambassadors Conference at Frankfurt on February 5, 1951. For documentation, see
                    Documents 74 ff.</p>
